5. Analyze the Patch
cd /u01/stage/<patch_number> $ORACLE_HOME/OPatch/opatch prereq CheckConflictAgainstOHWithDetail -ph ./

Download Patch: Obtain the required patch from My Oracle Support and place it in an accessible directory.

Step 2: Shutdown Services

Stop the database and listener:

sqlplus / as sysdba
SQL> shutdown immediate;
lsnrctl stop

Step 3: Apply the Patch

Unzip the patch file:

unzip p<patch_number>.zip -d /u01/app/oracle/product/19.0.0/dbhome_1/OPatch/

Navigate to the patch directory and apply it:

/u01/app/oracle/product/19.0.0/dbhome_1/OPatch/opatch apply -oh /u01/app/oracle/product/19.0.0/dbhome_1

Confirm prompts during the patching process.

